        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Morpeth Arms, SIS Building, Vauxhall Cross\n- Organizations: Secret Intelligence Service, MI6\n- Topics: Spying Room, intelligence headquarters\n\nFacts:\n- The SIS Building, also called the MI6 Building, is at Vauxhall Cross.\n- The SIS Building houses the headquarters of the Secret Intelligence Service, also known as SIS or MI6, which is the United Kingdom's foreign intelligence agency.\n- Morpeth Arms now contains a Spying Room.\n- The Spying Room in Morpeth Arms provides a good view across the river of the headquarters of the Secret Intelligence Service in the SIS Building.",
